<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>NLog</id>
    <version>5.5.0</version>
    <title>NLog for .NET Framework and .NET Standard</title>
    <authors>Jarek Kowalski,Kim Christensen,Julian Verdurmen</authors>
    <license type="expression">BSD-3-Clause</license>
    <licenseUrl>https://licenses.nuget.org/BSD-3-Clause</licenseUrl>
    <icon>N.png</icon>
    <projectUrl>https://nlog-project.org/</projectUrl>
    <description>NLog is a logging platform for .NET with rich log routing and management capabilities.
NLog supports traditional logging, structured logging and the combination of both.

Supported platforms:

- .NET 5, 6, 7, 8 and 9
- .NET Core 1, 2 and 3
- .NET Standard 1.3+ and 2.0+
- .NET Framework 3.5 - 4.8
- Xamarin Android + iOS (.NET Standard)
- Mono 4

For ASP.NET Core, check: https://www.nuget.org/packages/NLog.Web.AspNetCore</description>
    <releaseNotes>ChangeLog:
- Restored LogFactory.Setup().SetupFromEnvironmentVariables() as not obsolete (#5710) @snakefoot
- Avoid using MakeGenericType for Dictionary enumeration when AOT (#5717) @snakefoot
- Stop using obsolete Assembly.CodeBase for NetStandard (#5730) @snakefoot
- ExceptionLayoutRenderer - Handle Exception properties like StackTrace can throw with AOT (#5742) @snakefoot
- ExceptionLayoutRenderer - Handle Data-collection-item ToString can throw with AOT (#5743) @snakefoot
- ExceptionLayoutRenderer - Handle Exception-properties can throw with AOT (#5763) @snakefoot
- ServiceRepository - Improve exception-handling when resolving service-types while disposing (#5756) @snakefoot
- LayoutRenderer - Optimize performance by skipping cache result from render Inner Layout (#5759) @snakefoot
- ConditionLayoutExpression  - Optimize performance by skipping cache result from render Inner Layout (#5795) @snakefoot
- Mark IFactory RegisterType as obsolete, since it will be removed with NLog v6 (#5731) @snakefoot
- Mark JsonLayout EscapeForwardSlash as obsolete, since disabled with NLog v6 (#5766) @snakefoot
- Mark ExceptionLayoutRenderer Formats-List as obsolete, since immutable with NLog v6 (#5823) @snakefoot
- Updated API-code examples to not depend on obsolete SimpleConfigurator (#5769) @snakefoot
- ObjectReflectionCache - Handle PropertyValue can throw with AOT (#5776) @snakefoot
- NetworkTarget - Introduced option NoDelay to disable delayed ACK (#5780) @snakefoot
- Fix InternalLogger noise about reflection for FuncLayoutRenderer (#5788) @snakefoot
- TargetWithContext - Reduce allocation for RenderLogEvent when SimpleLayout (#5792) @snakefoot
- Refactoring to improve null value handling (#5810) @snakefoot
- Refactoring to improve null value handling (#5812) @snakefoot
- LoggingConfigurationParser - Prioritize LoggingRules from current config (#5817) @snakefoot
- WhenEmptyLayoutRendererWrapper - Optimize IStringValueRenderer Logic (#5825) @snakefoot

NLog v5.2 changes how to load extensions: https://nlog-project.org/2023/05/30/nlog-5-2-trim-warnings.html

List of major changes in NLog 5.0: https://nlog-project.org/2022/05/16/nlog-5-0-finally-ready.html

Full changelog: https://github.com/NLog/NLog/releases

For all config options and platform support, check https://nlog-project.org/config/</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2004-2025 NLog Project - https://nlog-project.org/</copyright>
    <tags>NLog logging log structured tracing logfiles database eventlog console email</tags>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/NLog/NLog.git" commit="1873145cbc26e0312d9481234d69ce7dc68aac4e" />
